1
00:01:43,680 --> 00:01:44,879
I'm Meng Tinghui.

2
00:01:44,879 --> 00:01:46,840
An Rulan, the Metropolitan Champion,

3
00:01:46,959 --> 00:01:48,200
stole my policy essay.

4
00:01:48,359 --> 00:01:49,640
Please do justice for me.

5
00:01:50,159 --> 00:01:51,239
Confucius says,

6
00:01:51,719 --> 00:01:53,000
think twice before you act.

7
00:01:53,480 --> 00:01:55,599
Twice is enough.

8
00:01:56,040 --> 00:01:58,560
You spread the copies all over the capital

9
00:01:58,760 --> 00:02:00,239
and caused a huge stir.

10
00:02:00,719 --> 00:02:01,840
Do you have solid proof?

11
00:02:01,920 --> 00:02:03,560
Sir, you can call An Rulan

12
00:02:03,719 --> 00:02:04,879
here to face me.

13
00:02:05,200 --> 00:02:05,959
Sir,

14
00:02:06,760 --> 00:02:08,239
all those people outside

15
00:02:08,400 --> 00:02:09,799
were brought here by her.

16
00:02:12,079 --> 00:02:13,200
Bring in Metropolitan Champion An.

17
00:02:45,199 --> 00:02:47,800
Greetings, Mr. Dong.

18
00:02:48,800 --> 00:02:50,080
Ms. An, no need for formalities.

19
00:02:50,439 --> 00:02:52,840
I've prepared a seat for you.

20
00:02:53,000 --> 00:02:53,879
Please take your seat.

21
00:02:54,360 --> 00:02:55,280
Jiang Mei'er,

22
00:02:55,840 --> 00:02:57,120
what are you doing here?

23
00:03:00,919 --> 00:03:01,759
Mr. Lyu,

24
00:03:01,960 --> 00:03:03,759
that wretch Meng Tinghui

25
00:03:04,520 --> 00:03:05,560
set up my uncle

26
00:03:05,560 --> 00:03:06,599
and Mr. Feng.

27
00:03:07,879 --> 00:03:09,759
I hate her so much I could eat her flesh

28
00:03:10,319 --> 00:03:11,599
and sleep on her skin.

29
00:03:16,360 --> 00:03:17,680
Where is she now?

30
00:03:18,199 --> 00:03:19,479
She's the Provincial Champion now.

31
00:03:19,919 --> 00:03:21,439
She'll go to the capital for the finals.

32
00:03:22,000 --> 00:03:23,439
I have a way to deal with her.

33
00:03:25,080 --> 00:03:26,639
If you help me,

34
00:03:27,439 --> 00:03:29,560
you'll be doing a great service for the Baron

35
00:03:30,360 --> 00:03:31,680
in finding the real killer.

36
00:03:39,639 --> 00:03:41,400
Just help me,

37
00:03:45,879 --> 00:03:47,879
and I'm yours.

38
00:03:59,240 --> 00:04:01,240
You're talking nonsense.

39
00:04:01,560 --> 00:04:02,919
Have you lost it?

40
00:04:04,840 --> 00:04:05,879
Sir, please see the truth.

41
00:04:06,719 --> 00:04:08,280
Her real name is Jiang Mei'er.

42
00:04:08,479 --> 00:04:10,439
Her uncle was the former prefect of Shazhou.

43
00:04:10,599 --> 00:04:11,159
She and I both studied

44
00:04:11,159 --> 00:04:12,719
at the Shazhou Women's Academy.

45
00:04:13,080 --> 00:04:14,439
Back in Shazhou, she did nothing

46
00:04:14,439 --> 00:04:15,280
but bully her classmates

47
00:04:15,560 --> 00:04:17,840
and throw her weight around.

48
00:04:18,000 --> 00:04:19,280
She can change her name

49
00:04:19,280 --> 00:04:20,280
and deny it all she wants.

50
00:04:20,840 --> 00:04:22,120
But since she's the Metropolitan Champion,

51
00:04:22,400 --> 00:04:24,079
she must have real talent.

52
00:04:24,560 --> 00:04:25,560
Sir,

53
00:04:25,879 --> 00:04:27,839
allow me to debate the classics

54
00:04:27,920 --> 00:04:29,120
with Ms. An right here.

55
00:04:33,360 --> 00:04:34,879
Why are you all here today?

56
00:04:35,519 --> 00:04:37,160
You're here for justice, right?

57
00:04:37,560 --> 00:04:39,279
Then let's see

58
00:04:39,279 --> 00:04:40,720
just how much real talent

59
00:04:40,959 --> 00:04:43,079
the Metropolitan Champion actually has!

60
00:04:43,720 --> 00:04:44,480
That's right!

61
00:04:44,639 --> 00:04:46,079
We want to see real talent!

62
00:04:46,240 --> 00:04:46,959
Real talent!

63
00:04:46,959 --> 00:04:47,959
We want to see real talent!

64
00:04:47,959 --> 00:04:48,560
Real talent!

65
00:04:48,560 --> 00:04:49,959
We want to see real talent!

66
00:04:51,360 --> 00:04:52,000
Alright.

67
00:04:52,800 --> 00:04:54,519
I love people

68
00:04:54,600 --> 00:04:56,519
with real talent too.

69
00:04:58,560 --> 00:04:59,560
"When a nation prospers,

70
00:04:59,879 --> 00:05:01,000
it cherishes its people as wounded children.

71
00:05:01,079 --> 00:05:02,000
That is its blessing;

72
00:05:02,680 --> 00:05:03,680
when it falls,

73
00:05:04,040 --> 00:05:05,279
it treats them like dirt.

74
00:05:05,680 --> 00:05:06,759
That is its curse."

75
00:05:06,759 --> 00:05:08,000
Does this quote come from The Book of Rites

76
00:05:08,000 --> 00:05:08,879
or The Book of Documents?

77
00:05:15,680 --> 00:05:17,519
It's from The Book of Rites.

78
00:05:21,560 --> 00:05:21,920
No.

79
00:05:21,920 --> 00:05:22,519
The Book of Documents.

80
00:05:27,879 --> 00:05:29,240
It's from Zuo's Commentary.

81
00:05:29,759 --> 00:05:30,639
I just

82
00:05:30,639 --> 00:05:31,920
misremembered.

83
00:05:32,399 --> 00:05:33,399
What can a few words

84
00:05:33,399 --> 00:05:34,360
prove?

85
00:05:36,120 --> 00:05:37,319
Did you all hear that?

86
00:05:38,319 --> 00:05:40,319
That's a classic everyone knows.

87
00:05:40,519 --> 00:05:42,079
Yet she's saying she misremembered.

88
00:05:42,199 --> 00:05:43,879
Can someone this muddled

89
00:05:44,040 --> 00:05:45,079
really be the Metropolitan Champion?

90
00:05:45,600 --> 00:05:46,759
Has the Great Ning imperial exam

91
00:05:46,759 --> 00:05:47,879
become a joke?

92
00:05:48,120 --> 00:05:48,959
That's right!

93
00:05:49,759 --> 00:05:51,519
Exactly!

94
00:05:52,040 --> 00:05:53,839
- That's right!
- That's right!

95
00:05:53,839 --> 00:05:54,519
Sir,

96
00:05:54,839 --> 00:05:55,680
the Metropolitan Champion essay

97
00:05:55,680 --> 00:05:56,879
was not written by her.

98
00:05:57,480 --> 00:05:58,720
I beg you to see the truth.

99
00:05:59,160 --> 00:05:59,920
Confucius says,

100
00:05:59,920 --> 00:06:01,199
know what you know.

101
00:06:01,399 --> 00:06:02,040
Sir,

102
00:06:02,560 --> 00:06:04,000
I studied for years

103
00:06:04,000 --> 00:06:04,959
to earn this title.

104
00:06:05,240 --> 00:06:06,959
Now she's framing me like this.

105
00:06:07,279 --> 00:06:08,800
Please, you have to stand up for me!

106
00:06:09,519 --> 00:06:10,319
Confucius says,

107
00:06:10,319 --> 00:06:11,399
watch what a person does

108
00:06:11,399 --> 00:06:12,399
and why they do it.

109
00:06:12,399 --> 00:06:12,920
Sir,

110
00:06:12,920 --> 00:06:14,120
since she insists the essay

111
00:06:14,120 --> 00:06:15,079
is hers,

112
00:06:15,720 --> 00:06:17,480
why not have her rewrite it on the spot?

113
00:06:17,959 --> 00:06:19,879
I'll take the test alongside her.

114
00:06:20,480 --> 00:06:21,639
Then we'll see

115
00:06:21,920 --> 00:06:22,800
who's telling the truth.

116
00:06:22,800 --> 00:06:23,399
Sir.

117
00:06:23,800 --> 00:06:24,879
No need for a retest.

118
00:06:25,360 --> 00:06:27,160
These words in black and white are mine.

119
00:06:27,160 --> 00:06:27,839
Can't be wrong.

120
00:06:28,160 --> 00:06:29,600
Can you let me

121
00:06:29,759 --> 00:06:30,720
finish my sentence?

122
00:06:30,920 --> 00:06:32,360
All this shouting.

123
00:06:32,360 --> 00:06:33,399
What a disgrace!

124
00:06:33,920 --> 00:06:35,480
This isn't the exam hall.

125
00:06:35,920 --> 00:06:37,000
No tests here!

126
00:06:37,199 --> 00:06:39,600
Do you really think

127
00:06:39,680 --> 00:06:40,680
you can twist the truth

128
00:06:40,680 --> 00:06:42,319
with your slick tongue?

129
00:06:44,040 --> 00:06:44,920
Jiang Mei'er.

130
00:06:45,360 --> 00:06:46,040
If I

131
00:06:46,040 --> 00:06:47,199
could take down your uncle,

132
00:06:47,720 --> 00:06:49,399
I can take you down too.

133
00:06:50,000 --> 00:06:50,759
Didn't you see

134
00:06:50,759 --> 00:06:52,199
how your uncle died?

135
00:06:53,360 --> 00:06:55,040
A crossbow bolt through the heart.

136
00:06:55,120 --> 00:06:56,199
He died in one shot.

137
00:06:56,560 --> 00:06:57,879
Let me guess

138
00:06:58,879 --> 00:06:59,759
how you stole

139
00:06:59,759 --> 00:07:01,120
my Metropolitan Champion title.

140
00:07:02,399 --> 00:07:03,240
Was it through your uncle's

141
00:07:03,240 --> 00:07:04,560
pathetic connections?

142
00:07:05,160 --> 00:07:06,279
Or

143
00:07:08,279 --> 00:07:09,199
did you make

144
00:07:09,199 --> 00:07:10,800
some dirty deal?

145
00:07:12,079 --> 00:07:13,439
You care more about your face

146
00:07:13,439 --> 00:07:14,879
than anything.

147
00:07:16,279 --> 00:07:18,360
You fancy yourself the fairest.

148
00:07:19,079 --> 00:07:20,800
Don't tell me you got it through...

149
00:07:22,439 --> 00:07:24,160
Just help me,

150
00:07:25,680 --> 00:07:27,600
and I'm yours.

151
00:07:31,040 --> 00:07:32,519
Shut your mouth!

152
00:07:34,240 --> 00:07:35,360
Meng Tinghui!

153
00:07:36,759 --> 00:07:37,959
Order!

154
00:07:37,959 --> 00:07:38,879
You lunatic!

155
00:07:40,319 --> 00:07:41,279
The trial's not over yet.

156
00:07:41,360 --> 00:07:42,279
Separate them!

157
00:07:42,279 --> 00:07:43,279
Court adjourned!

158
00:07:44,399 --> 00:07:45,560
The trial's not over yet!

159
00:07:50,279 --> 00:07:52,000
Meng Tinghui!

160
00:07:52,360 --> 00:07:53,959
You've ruined me.

161
00:07:54,120 --> 00:07:55,560
I'll kill you!

162
00:07:57,600 --> 00:07:58,279
Sir,

163
00:07:58,759 --> 00:07:59,920
you heard her, didn't you?

164
00:08:00,079 --> 00:08:01,519
Isn't the truth clear enough?

165
00:08:03,879 --> 00:08:04,519
Guards.

166
00:08:05,199 --> 00:08:07,120
Arrest this fraud who stole

167
00:08:07,120 --> 00:08:09,439
the title of Metropolitan Champion.

168
00:08:23,839 --> 00:08:25,959
So you're all

169
00:08:25,959 --> 00:08:27,279
in cahoots!

170
00:08:27,839 --> 00:08:29,160
The exam hall

171
00:08:30,160 --> 00:08:31,439
and the courtroom

172
00:08:32,079 --> 00:08:32,959
are full of

173
00:08:32,959 --> 00:08:35,000
wolves that devour their prey!

174
00:08:36,839 --> 00:08:38,720
Now you understand that?

175
00:08:39,799 --> 00:08:40,919
Too bad.

176
00:08:41,360 --> 00:08:42,639
It's too late.

177
00:08:44,080 --> 00:08:44,559
You thought

178
00:08:44,559 --> 00:08:46,039
bringing a bunch of ignorant commoners

179
00:08:46,039 --> 00:08:47,200
would help you?

180
00:08:51,480 --> 00:08:52,360
In the end,

181
00:08:52,360 --> 00:08:53,720
you still fell into my hands.

182
00:08:54,240 --> 00:08:55,440
From now on,

183
00:08:55,879 --> 00:08:57,200
there is

184
00:08:57,360 --> 00:08:58,159
no Meng Tinghui

185
00:08:58,159 --> 00:09:00,200
in the women's special exam.

186
00:09:05,600 --> 00:09:06,600
In this world,

187
00:09:10,720 --> 00:09:11,879
the shameless

188
00:09:13,799 --> 00:09:15,919
outlive the fearless.

189
00:09:16,200 --> 00:09:17,279
Meng Tinghui,

190
00:09:18,440 --> 00:09:19,919
whether in Shazhou

191
00:09:20,159 --> 00:09:21,440
or the capital,

192
00:09:22,039 --> 00:09:23,759
I can easily destroy

193
00:09:24,639 --> 00:09:27,200
everything you cherish.

194
00:09:27,759 --> 00:09:28,759
Destroy it!

195
00:09:35,080 --> 00:09:35,960
Let me go!

196
00:09:35,960 --> 00:09:36,720
Pull them apart!

197
00:09:36,720 --> 00:09:38,159
If you ruin me, you won't live either!

198
00:09:42,679 --> 00:09:43,519
This is a courtroom!

199
00:09:43,519 --> 00:09:45,320
You're both a disgrace to scholars!

200
00:09:46,039 --> 00:09:46,960
Confucius says,

201
00:09:47,039 --> 00:09:49,320
in ritual, harmony matters most.

202
00:09:49,799 --> 00:09:50,679
Meng,

203
00:09:51,080 --> 00:09:52,360
just confess to

204
00:09:52,360 --> 00:09:55,440
falsely accusing the Metropolitan Champion,

205
00:09:55,480 --> 00:09:57,879
and I'll make sure you stay alive.

206
00:09:58,200 --> 00:09:58,799
Sir.

207
00:09:59,279 --> 00:10:00,639
She caused such a scene

208
00:10:00,840 --> 00:10:02,320
and nearly killed me.

209
00:10:02,320 --> 00:10:03,879
She can't be spared.

210
00:10:03,879 --> 00:10:04,799
The case of the real Metropolitan Champion

211
00:10:04,799 --> 00:10:06,360
is already public knowledge.

212
00:10:07,519 --> 00:10:08,799
If something happens to me,

213
00:10:09,519 --> 00:10:11,519
it'll only prove my accusation.

214
00:10:12,120 --> 00:10:12,679
Can you

215
00:10:12,679 --> 00:10:14,320
still wash your hands of it then, sir?

216
00:10:14,360 --> 00:10:15,840
If you stop now,

217
00:10:16,600 --> 00:10:17,759
you might still save your own neck.

218
00:10:19,000 --> 00:10:20,559
Smooth talker.

219
00:10:20,559 --> 00:10:21,200
Sir.

220
00:10:21,440 --> 00:10:22,480
Arrest her.

221
00:10:22,639 --> 00:10:23,279
Confucius says,

222
00:10:23,759 --> 00:10:25,639
don't meddle where you don't belong.

223
00:10:26,480 --> 00:10:27,639
I know what I'm doing

224
00:10:27,960 --> 00:10:29,279
with this case.

225
00:10:29,600 --> 00:10:31,240
Keep your opinions to yourself, Ms. An.

226
00:10:32,440 --> 00:10:33,519
Throw her in jail.

227
00:10:38,480 --> 00:10:39,159
Sir.

228
00:10:39,159 --> 00:10:40,559
We got visitors from Tiger Roar.

229
00:11:02,799 --> 00:11:05,000
Mr. Lyu. Ms. An.

230
00:11:16,200 --> 00:11:16,960
Come here.

231
00:11:20,480 --> 00:11:21,360
Mr. Dong,

232
00:11:21,919 --> 00:11:24,080
what do you plan to do with Meng Tinghui?

233
00:11:25,039 --> 00:11:26,519
I've already arranged it.

234
00:11:27,240 --> 00:11:28,279
I'll announce

235
00:11:28,399 --> 00:11:29,360
that Meng Tinghui

236
00:11:29,360 --> 00:11:31,080
went mad from failing the exam.

237
00:11:31,399 --> 00:11:32,840
I'll lock her up for a while.

238
00:11:33,080 --> 00:11:34,200
Once things die down,

239
00:11:34,200 --> 00:11:36,159
I'll send her back to Shazhou.

240
00:11:37,000 --> 00:11:38,919
You're quite the upright official.

241
00:11:40,399 --> 00:11:41,799
Ms. An, you flatter me.

242
00:11:41,799 --> 00:11:42,799
I figured

243
00:11:43,080 --> 00:11:45,120
killing Meng Tinghui

244
00:11:45,240 --> 00:11:47,200
would only blow things up.

245
00:11:47,480 --> 00:11:49,799
I'm doing this for the greater good.

246
00:11:53,240 --> 00:11:54,559
Mr. Lyu,

247
00:11:54,960 --> 00:11:56,039
see that?

248
00:11:56,600 --> 00:11:57,399
He

249
00:11:57,399 --> 00:11:59,080
doesn't respect you at all.

250
00:11:59,320 --> 00:12:01,159
He's leaving himself a way out.

251
00:12:05,679 --> 00:12:06,879
Mei'er, don't worry.

252
00:12:08,919 --> 00:12:10,519
I've already invited Mrs. Dong

253
00:12:10,799 --> 00:12:11,960
and her kid

254
00:12:12,519 --> 00:12:14,200
for tea at the teahouse.

255
00:12:19,600 --> 00:12:20,960
This... You...

256
00:12:21,200 --> 00:12:22,519
What are you doing?

257
00:12:23,879 --> 00:12:25,480
I did exactly what you said.

258
00:12:25,720 --> 00:12:26,919
What more do you want?

259
00:12:27,759 --> 00:12:28,879
I want to see the Baron!

260
00:12:34,559 --> 00:12:35,559
See the Baron?

261
00:12:38,120 --> 00:12:40,080
Now you think you can walk all over me?

262
00:12:41,799 --> 00:12:42,679
Dong Shoucai.

263
00:12:43,039 --> 00:12:44,200
That title of yours

264
00:12:44,759 --> 00:12:46,840
was a gift from the Gang.

265
00:12:47,120 --> 00:12:49,080
How dare you put on airs with me!

266
00:12:50,919 --> 00:12:51,840
Don't forget.

267
00:12:52,799 --> 00:12:54,200
You still haven't repaid what you owe

268
00:12:54,200 --> 00:12:55,240
from buying your official post.

269
00:12:55,840 --> 00:12:57,440
If the Baron finds out,

270
00:12:58,039 --> 00:12:59,600
you're as good as dead!

271
00:13:03,919 --> 00:13:06,000
So think carefully, Mr. Dong.

272
00:13:06,679 --> 00:13:10,440
Do you want wealth and glory,

273
00:13:11,840 --> 00:13:13,799
or do you want to lose your family?

274
00:13:16,240 --> 00:13:17,440
I'll leave it all to you,

275
00:13:17,440 --> 00:13:18,720
Mr. Lyu, Ms. An.

276
00:13:33,039 --> 00:13:35,279
Arrest everyone involved

277
00:13:35,279 --> 00:13:36,360
in the exam fraud

278
00:13:36,679 --> 00:13:39,039
and hold them for trial.

279
00:13:39,679 --> 00:13:40,600
Yes, Your Majesty.

280
00:13:42,279 --> 00:13:43,000
Take them away!

281
00:13:51,279 --> 00:13:51,960
Your Majesty,

282
00:13:52,240 --> 00:13:53,399
Zhili told me

283
00:13:53,399 --> 00:13:54,279
to rush this to you.

284
00:13:54,480 --> 00:13:55,639
It's a petition for justice

285
00:13:55,639 --> 00:13:57,320
written by Meng Tinghui.

286
00:13:57,519 --> 00:13:58,720
It's been copied countless times

287
00:13:59,200 --> 00:14:00,279
and spread throughout the streets

288
00:14:00,279 --> 00:14:01,200
of the capital.

289
00:14:05,320 --> 00:14:06,440
She sure knows

290
00:14:06,840 --> 00:14:08,519
how to set a fire fast and fierce.

291
00:14:08,759 --> 00:14:09,960
Where is she now?

292
00:14:09,960 --> 00:14:11,600
She's now at the capital prefecture.

293
00:14:12,360 --> 00:14:13,399
To the capital prefecture.

294
00:14:46,240 --> 00:14:46,919
Jiang Mei'er.

295
00:14:48,840 --> 00:14:50,559
You'd better kill me today.

296
00:14:51,639 --> 00:14:53,679
Or I'll make your life a living hell.

297
00:14:54,320 --> 00:14:55,679
Killing you with one strike

298
00:14:56,639 --> 00:14:57,840
would be too boring.

299
00:14:58,120 --> 00:15:00,080
I want to torture you

300
00:15:00,080 --> 00:15:01,519
bit by bit.

301
00:15:02,320 --> 00:15:05,559
I'll get it all back a thousand times over!

302
00:15:16,000 --> 00:15:17,559
Anything else you want to say?

303
00:15:19,360 --> 00:15:20,960
You deserve it.

304
00:15:21,000 --> 00:15:22,360
You deserve to die.

305
00:15:22,440 --> 00:15:24,519
One day you'll pay for what you've done.

306
00:15:37,799 --> 00:15:39,120
She failed to frame me,

307
00:15:39,120 --> 00:15:40,279
so she killed herself,

308
00:15:40,399 --> 00:15:42,120
set the jail on fire, and burned to death.

309
00:15:42,120 --> 00:15:42,960
Understand?

310
00:15:43,039 --> 00:15:43,879
- Yes!
- Yes.

311
00:17:13,599 --> 00:17:14,759
Still trying to run?

312
00:17:15,200 --> 00:17:16,160
Meng Tinghui,

313
00:17:16,359 --> 00:17:17,440
you killed over a hundred men

314
00:17:17,440 --> 00:17:18,359
of the Black Tiger Gang!

315
00:17:18,480 --> 00:17:20,160
Now I'll make you join them in death!

316
00:17:23,119 --> 00:17:23,960
Meng Tinghui!

317
00:17:28,359 --> 00:17:29,200
Meng Tinghui!

318
00:17:30,240 --> 00:17:32,240
Since the fire couldn't kill you,

319
00:17:32,559 --> 00:17:34,839
I'll finish you off myself.

320
00:17:41,720 --> 00:17:42,359
Fall back!

321
00:17:43,519 --> 00:17:45,119
Meng Tinghui, you lunatic!

322
00:18:26,480 --> 00:18:27,200
She's there!

323
00:18:34,400 --> 00:18:35,519
I'll kill you!

324
00:18:39,359 --> 00:18:39,880
Get back!

325
00:18:42,000 --> 00:18:42,640
After her!

326
00:19:04,720 --> 00:19:05,920
Hal,

327
00:19:06,400 --> 00:19:08,279
they're trying to kill me.

328
00:19:10,519 --> 00:19:11,440
Leave it to me.

329
00:19:23,559 --> 00:19:25,240
I studied

330
00:19:25,880 --> 00:19:27,400
for years,

331
00:19:28,279 --> 00:19:30,440
living by the teachings of the sages.

332
00:19:31,039 --> 00:19:32,720
The day I passed the exam,

333
00:19:33,640 --> 00:19:35,680
I swore

334
00:19:36,200 --> 00:19:37,880
to be an upright official.

335
00:19:38,319 --> 00:19:40,279
But I took a wrong turn

336
00:19:40,799 --> 00:19:42,240
and went down the wrong path.

337
00:19:43,000 --> 00:19:46,119
I've been a coward my whole life.

338
00:19:47,079 --> 00:19:48,640
I deserve this.

339
00:19:49,440 --> 00:19:51,039
I regret it deeply.

340
00:19:51,960 --> 00:19:53,680
I will pay with my life.

341
00:19:54,599 --> 00:19:56,359
But my family is innocent.

342
00:19:57,359 --> 00:19:58,640
Please show mercy,

343
00:19:59,880 --> 00:20:01,759
Your Majesty.

344
00:20:27,279 --> 00:20:28,039
Ms. Meng.

345
00:20:47,039 --> 00:20:47,920
Meng

346
00:20:47,920 --> 00:20:49,400
is just an orphan from the streets.

347
00:20:49,400 --> 00:20:50,400
How could His Majesty

348
00:20:50,400 --> 00:20:51,839
personally seek justice for her?

349
00:20:53,039 --> 00:20:55,039
So many noble ladies in the court

350
00:20:55,079 --> 00:20:56,880
are desperate for His Majesty's favor,

351
00:20:57,200 --> 00:20:58,480
but he won't even glance at them.

352
00:20:58,720 --> 00:21:01,119
Yet he values her so much.

353
00:21:01,720 --> 00:21:03,599
His Majesty values the imperial exam.

354
00:21:03,960 --> 00:21:05,200
This was his first exam

355
00:21:05,200 --> 00:21:06,319
since he took the throne,

356
00:21:06,680 --> 00:21:08,279
and it was tainted by fraud.

357
00:21:08,400 --> 00:21:09,599
His Majesty is showing

358
00:21:09,799 --> 00:21:11,599
his resolve to the whole world.

359
00:21:11,759 --> 00:21:13,480
But she shouldn't enter the palace.

360
00:21:14,160 --> 00:21:16,240
Since His Majesty was young,

361
00:21:16,240 --> 00:21:16,839
no woman

362
00:21:16,839 --> 00:21:18,240
other than you

363
00:21:18,240 --> 00:21:19,319
has ever lived in the palace.

364
00:21:19,799 --> 00:21:20,759
I'm afraid

365
00:21:20,759 --> 00:21:22,039
she wants to stay in the palace for good.

366
00:21:22,039 --> 00:21:22,720
After all,

367
00:21:22,720 --> 00:21:24,359
that's much easier than taking the exam.

368
00:21:24,559 --> 00:21:25,319
Hal!

369
00:21:31,079 --> 00:21:31,839
Ms. Meng.

370
00:21:35,680 --> 00:21:36,480
It's you.

371
00:21:37,640 --> 00:21:38,839
Where am I?

372
00:21:38,839 --> 00:21:39,839
Can't you tell?

373
00:21:39,839 --> 00:21:41,119
This is the palace.

374
00:21:42,559 --> 00:21:43,279
Actually,

375
00:21:43,359 --> 00:21:44,240
I was going to ask you.

376
00:21:44,319 --> 00:21:45,200
In Shazhou,

377
00:21:45,279 --> 00:21:45,960
what exactly happened

378
00:21:45,960 --> 00:21:47,279
between you and His Majesty?

379
00:21:47,720 --> 00:21:48,559
Chief Steward You,

380
00:21:48,759 --> 00:21:50,240
when I stepped out,

381
00:21:50,240 --> 00:21:51,720
His Majesty said he wanted some soup.

382
00:21:51,799 --> 00:21:52,920
You should hurry back and check.

383
00:21:53,880 --> 00:21:54,559
Alright.

384
00:21:59,039 --> 00:21:59,880
Ms. Meng,

385
00:22:00,039 --> 00:22:01,119
you're finally awake.

386
00:22:01,519 --> 00:22:02,720
His Majesty saved you.

387
00:22:02,920 --> 00:22:04,480
You've been out for two days

388
00:22:04,480 --> 00:22:05,720
with a high fever.

389
00:22:05,920 --> 00:22:07,400
Are you feeling any better now?

390
00:22:10,720 --> 00:22:11,960
This is from the imperial physician.

391
00:22:12,039 --> 00:22:13,279
It strengthens your body and reduces fever.

392
00:22:13,480 --> 00:22:14,519
Drink it while it's warm.

393
00:22:16,720 --> 00:22:18,400
He's actually the Emperor.

394
00:22:21,119 --> 00:22:22,000
We met briefly

395
00:22:22,640 --> 00:22:23,799
at the exam hall entrance

396
00:22:23,799 --> 00:22:24,720
back then,

397
00:22:25,279 --> 00:22:27,519
and now we meet again in the palace.

398
00:22:28,559 --> 00:22:30,000
Thank you for taking care of me.

399
00:22:30,000 --> 00:22:31,119
Don't mention it.

400
00:22:32,000 --> 00:22:33,480
On the day of the Metropolitan Exam,

401
00:22:33,559 --> 00:22:35,200
I thought I'd be the top scorer.

402
00:22:35,480 --> 00:22:37,079
But there's always someone better.

403
00:22:37,319 --> 00:22:38,440
After reading your essay,

404
00:22:38,440 --> 00:22:40,000
I couldn't sleep at night.

405
00:22:40,559 --> 00:22:41,319
I just wanted to

406
00:22:41,359 --> 00:22:43,079
meet the person who wrote it.

407
00:22:43,160 --> 00:22:44,599
I never expected it to be you.

408
00:22:44,720 --> 00:22:46,160
I'm truly delighted.

409
00:22:48,160 --> 00:22:49,160
Do you know

410
00:22:49,799 --> 00:22:51,400
how Ms. Yan is doing now?

411
00:22:51,400 --> 00:22:52,200
Don't worry.

412
00:22:52,440 --> 00:22:54,480
Ms. Yan has been sent back to Spring House.

413
00:22:54,680 --> 00:22:55,559
She's all right.

414
00:22:56,359 --> 00:22:57,279
Drink it while it's warm.

415
00:23:00,640 --> 00:23:01,720
I'm still shaken

416
00:23:02,160 --> 00:23:03,799
when I think about what happened to you.

417
00:23:04,640 --> 00:23:06,039
Thankfully, you fought back brilliantly

418
00:23:06,440 --> 00:23:07,720
and didn't let them win.

419
00:23:08,039 --> 00:23:09,039
Now it's all good.

420
00:23:09,400 --> 00:23:10,440
His Majesty has restored

421
00:23:10,440 --> 00:23:11,559
your title of Metropolitan Champion

422
00:23:11,839 --> 00:23:13,440
and thrown Jiang Mei'er in jail.

423
00:23:13,680 --> 00:23:15,000
That's truly satisfying.

424
00:23:16,440 --> 00:23:18,240
Has His Majesty been here lately?

425
00:23:18,559 --> 00:23:19,240
No.

426
00:23:19,599 --> 00:23:21,000
With such a big incident,

427
00:23:21,160 --> 00:23:22,319
he's very busy.

428
00:23:22,880 --> 00:23:24,519
But he did tell me

429
00:23:24,519 --> 00:23:25,440
to take good care of you.

430
00:23:25,799 --> 00:23:27,640
Can I go see him?

431
00:23:27,640 --> 00:23:29,119
Focus on recovering first.

432
00:23:29,359 --> 00:23:30,240
I can pass along

433
00:23:30,359 --> 00:23:31,519
any message for you.

434
00:23:31,799 --> 00:23:33,000
I want to go to the Ministry of Justice.

435
00:23:49,559 --> 00:23:50,200
Captain Huang.

436
00:23:51,960 --> 00:23:52,759
Captain Huang.

437
00:23:53,279 --> 00:23:54,839
I'd like to speak with her alone.

438
00:24:12,079 --> 00:24:12,759
Go on.

439
00:24:13,079 --> 00:24:14,839
How did you get in with Lyu Er,

440
00:24:15,319 --> 00:24:16,480
bribe the examiners,

441
00:24:17,119 --> 00:24:18,279
and set the fire to kill me?

442
00:24:19,279 --> 00:24:20,160
You're

443
00:24:20,799 --> 00:24:22,200
no better than me.

444
00:24:23,640 --> 00:24:24,559
You only got to

445
00:24:24,559 --> 00:24:26,119
where you are

446
00:24:26,119 --> 00:24:27,680
by climbing into the Emperor's bed.

447
00:24:28,480 --> 00:24:29,759
Without a man,

448
00:24:30,400 --> 00:24:31,839
you're nothing!

449
00:24:35,880 --> 00:24:37,000
Meng Tinghui.

450
00:24:38,039 --> 00:24:39,799
You're still so arrogant

451
00:24:40,079 --> 00:24:41,480
and self-righteous.

452
00:24:41,960 --> 00:24:43,839
You know what I hate most about you?

453
00:24:45,720 --> 00:24:47,440
It's those eyes of yours.

454
00:24:48,400 --> 00:24:49,480
You're just a

455
00:24:49,480 --> 00:24:51,240
lowly orphan.

456
00:24:51,240 --> 00:24:51,759
What gives you the right

457
00:24:51,759 --> 00:24:53,160
to look at me like that?

458
00:24:55,039 --> 00:24:55,960
I

459
00:24:57,359 --> 00:24:58,839
come from a noble family

460
00:24:59,359 --> 00:25:00,839
and have unparalleled beauty.

461
00:25:02,759 --> 00:25:05,559
I was supposed to have a glorious life.

462
00:25:07,160 --> 00:25:08,319
It's all your fault.

463
00:25:09,960 --> 00:25:12,400
You pushed me to this.

464
00:25:12,759 --> 00:25:14,759
You forced me to get rid of you!

465
00:25:15,759 --> 00:25:16,440
How much more

466
00:25:16,440 --> 00:25:18,079
do you want to destroy me?

467
00:25:18,079 --> 00:25:18,759
You were the one

468
00:25:18,759 --> 00:25:20,400
who destroyed yourself!

469
00:25:21,599 --> 00:25:23,640
You thought your name protected you.

470
00:25:24,319 --> 00:25:25,559
You had power,

471
00:25:26,039 --> 00:25:27,720
but all you did was bully the innocent.

472
00:25:28,079 --> 00:25:29,400
Your jealousy,

473
00:25:29,400 --> 00:25:30,599
greed, and delusions

474
00:25:30,880 --> 00:25:32,119
drove you to ruin.

475
00:25:32,920 --> 00:25:34,599
If you confess honestly,

476
00:25:35,240 --> 00:25:36,519
maybe your sentence will be reduced.

477
00:25:37,240 --> 00:25:39,559
But you only get one chance.

478
00:25:45,839 --> 00:25:46,799
Meng Tinghui!

479
00:25:47,400 --> 00:25:49,559
Can you say you have no ambition?

480
00:25:50,359 --> 00:25:52,960
Can you say you don't want to climb higher?

481
00:25:53,480 --> 00:25:54,759
We're the exact

482
00:25:54,759 --> 00:25:55,799
same kind.

483
00:25:56,799 --> 00:25:58,279
You're just better

484
00:25:58,279 --> 00:26:00,559
at pretending than I am.

485
00:26:01,440 --> 00:26:02,839
Now you're pretending

486
00:26:02,839 --> 00:26:03,839
to spare me?

487
00:26:04,759 --> 00:26:06,839
Do you even believe that nonsense yourself?

488
00:26:06,839 --> 00:26:07,680
We were

489
00:26:07,680 --> 00:26:09,039
never the same kind!

490
00:26:10,000 --> 00:26:11,079
But you got one thing right.

491
00:26:13,759 --> 00:26:15,759
I do want to climb higher.

492
00:26:16,920 --> 00:26:18,319
And right now, I've climbed high enough

493
00:26:18,319 --> 00:26:20,319
to decide whether you live or die.

494
00:26:21,480 --> 00:26:22,319
You won't write?

495
00:26:23,839 --> 00:26:25,480
Since you don't want the chance,

496
00:26:27,039 --> 00:26:28,079
forget it.

497
00:26:35,319 --> 00:26:36,119
Meng Tinghui!

498
00:26:36,759 --> 00:26:37,519
I'll write.

499
00:26:38,440 --> 00:26:39,200
I'll write.

500
00:26:39,799 --> 00:26:41,119
Just spare me,

501
00:26:41,480 --> 00:26:42,960
and I'll do anything.

502
00:26:49,319 --> 00:26:50,400
My mother said

503
00:26:51,079 --> 00:26:52,400
living is what matters most.

504
00:26:54,359 --> 00:26:55,559
Survive.

505
00:26:56,799 --> 00:26:57,839
Only by staying alive

506
00:26:57,839 --> 00:26:59,759
can you start over.

507
00:27:06,319 --> 00:27:07,839
I have to live.

508
00:27:09,720 --> 00:27:11,400
I have to live.

509
00:27:26,359 --> 00:27:28,200
The second-in-command of the Tiger Roar Gang

510
00:27:28,880 --> 00:27:30,559
is known as Mr. Lyu Er.

511
00:27:31,039 --> 00:27:32,319
The Black Tiger Gang in Shazhou

512
00:27:32,319 --> 00:27:34,440
was just a branch of the Tiger Roar Gang.

513
00:27:34,599 --> 00:27:35,599
I confessed everything.

514
00:27:36,359 --> 00:27:38,079
You said you'd reduce my sentence.

515
00:27:40,119 --> 00:27:40,960
Yes.

516
00:27:42,319 --> 00:27:43,720
Your crimes are grave.

517
00:27:44,359 --> 00:27:45,839
You should have been executed by slicing.

518
00:27:46,599 --> 00:27:48,440
But His Majesty granted you a swift end.

519
00:27:48,839 --> 00:27:50,200
That's already mercy.

520
00:27:51,319 --> 00:27:53,200
Meng Tinghui!

521
00:27:53,400 --> 00:27:54,319
I was wrong.

522
00:27:54,680 --> 00:27:55,640
I'm sorry.

523
00:27:56,200 --> 00:27:57,519
Please.

524
00:27:58,039 --> 00:27:59,440
I beg you.

525
00:27:59,839 --> 00:28:00,440
I'm begging you!

526
00:28:00,440 --> 00:28:01,400
- Jiang Mei'er.
- Please spare me!

527
00:28:02,119 --> 00:28:02,960
I came today

528
00:28:02,960 --> 00:28:04,640
to see you off.

529
00:28:05,160 --> 00:28:05,920
I did...

530
00:28:06,200 --> 00:28:07,440
I did try to hurt you,

531
00:28:07,599 --> 00:28:08,200
but...

532
00:28:08,200 --> 00:28:08,960
but look,

533
00:28:08,960 --> 00:28:09,839
you're standing here

534
00:28:09,839 --> 00:28:11,000
just fine.

535
00:28:11,480 --> 00:28:13,480
And you even got His Majesty's favor.

536
00:28:13,599 --> 00:28:14,920
You should be thanking me

537
00:28:14,920 --> 00:28:17,039
for all this!

538
00:28:18,240 --> 00:28:20,000
Poison or silk.

539
00:28:20,799 --> 00:28:21,880
Take your pick.

540
00:28:33,960 --> 00:28:36,480
Meng Tinghui, you liar!

541
00:28:36,599 --> 00:28:38,279
You'll die a horrible death!

542
00:28:38,279 --> 00:28:40,519
The Tiger Roar Gang won't let you go.

543
00:28:40,559 --> 00:28:42,880
I'll come back to haunt you!

544
00:28:43,599 --> 00:28:45,680
I'm just afraid they won't come.

545
00:28:46,960 --> 00:28:48,279
No one who wrongs me

546
00:28:50,039 --> 00:28:52,000
will get away.

547
00:30:16,400 --> 00:30:17,839
Aren't the women at Balmy Pavilion

548
00:30:18,400 --> 00:30:19,640
enough for you?

549
00:30:19,640 --> 00:30:20,559
Baron, I was wrong.

550
00:30:21,240 --> 00:30:22,559
Dong Shoucai already killed himself in fear.

551
00:30:22,559 --> 00:30:23,319
Don't worry.

552
00:30:23,319 --> 00:30:24,359
He didn't say a word

553
00:30:24,359 --> 00:30:25,599
about the Tiger Roar Gang.

554
00:30:26,079 --> 00:30:26,759
Baron.

555
00:30:30,720 --> 00:30:31,240
Brother.

556
00:30:31,640 --> 00:30:32,160
Brother.

557
00:30:32,359 --> 00:30:33,200
I was wrong.

558
00:30:33,240 --> 00:30:33,799
Brother.

559
00:30:34,000 --> 00:30:35,119
I really was wrong.

560
00:30:35,119 --> 00:30:36,039
Spare me.

561
00:30:36,880 --> 00:30:37,480
Brother!

562
00:30:38,519 --> 00:30:39,839
Is this your first day in the game?

563
00:30:40,160 --> 00:30:40,960
That wretch

564
00:30:40,960 --> 00:30:42,039
already sold you out!

565
00:30:42,039 --> 00:30:42,720
Brother.

566
00:30:42,720 --> 00:30:43,599
I was completely blinded

567
00:30:43,599 --> 00:30:44,319
by that wretch.

568
00:30:44,960 --> 00:30:45,839
But I only wanted to

569
00:30:45,839 --> 00:30:46,880
find Meng Tinghui

570
00:30:46,880 --> 00:30:48,039
to help Baron vent his anger!

571
00:30:48,839 --> 00:30:49,440
Baron.

572
00:30:49,680 --> 00:30:50,240
Get up!

573
00:30:50,480 --> 00:30:50,920
Brother.

574
00:30:50,920 --> 00:30:52,000
You let your lust cloud your judgment

575
00:30:52,319 --> 00:30:53,480
and got used,

576
00:30:53,720 --> 00:30:55,079
and you call that helping Baron?

577
00:30:55,920 --> 00:30:57,960
Not afraid of court officials in life.

578
00:30:58,079 --> 00:30:59,880
Not afraid of the King of Hell in death.

579
00:31:01,279 --> 00:31:01,720
Baron.

580
00:31:01,720 --> 00:31:02,960
You're even more formidable

581
00:31:02,960 --> 00:31:03,920
than I am.

582
00:31:03,920 --> 00:31:04,640
Baron,

583
00:31:04,799 --> 00:31:05,640
please spare me!

584
00:31:08,599 --> 00:31:09,440
Get over here!

585
00:31:10,000 --> 00:31:10,519
Brother.

586
00:31:13,119 --> 00:31:13,720
Brother!

587
00:31:14,079 --> 00:31:16,000
I'm your little brother!

588
00:31:16,000 --> 00:31:16,720
Shut up.

589
00:31:16,720 --> 00:31:17,680
I don't want to die!

590
00:31:17,880 --> 00:31:18,480
Brother!

591
00:31:18,480 --> 00:31:19,680
I'm your own brother!

592
00:31:19,680 --> 00:31:20,279
Brother!

593
00:31:20,480 --> 00:31:21,079
Brother!

594
00:31:30,680 --> 00:31:31,359
Baron.

595
00:31:31,759 --> 00:31:32,720
This lesson

596
00:31:33,079 --> 00:31:34,359
will stick with him.

597
00:31:34,720 --> 00:31:35,880
Please let him stay

598
00:31:36,119 --> 00:31:38,079
and serve you

599
00:31:38,759 --> 00:31:40,079
to make amends.

600
00:31:49,279 --> 00:31:52,119
The Tiger Roar Gang spent ten years

601
00:31:53,400 --> 00:31:56,000
building a foothold in the capital.

602
00:31:58,319 --> 00:32:00,359
And now, because of him,

603
00:32:01,759 --> 00:32:03,640
we're being hunted all over the city.

604
00:32:04,039 --> 00:32:05,559
We've even caught the Emperor's attention.

605
00:32:06,000 --> 00:32:07,559
If we didn't have someone in the court,

606
00:32:08,039 --> 00:32:09,240
the entire Tiger Roar Gang

607
00:32:09,240 --> 00:32:10,279
would go down with you!

608
00:32:10,279 --> 00:32:12,119
No, Baron!

609
00:32:12,920 --> 00:32:14,480
It's my failure to teach him properly!

610
00:32:19,039 --> 00:32:19,759
Baron,

611
00:32:20,279 --> 00:32:21,519
we've followed you

612
00:32:21,759 --> 00:32:23,400
for over ten years.

613
00:32:23,559 --> 00:32:24,599
Please spare his life.

614
00:32:25,160 --> 00:32:26,319
I'm begging you.

615
00:32:35,359 --> 00:32:36,880
Everyone lie low for a while.

616
00:32:37,160 --> 00:32:38,599
Don't cause me any more trouble.

617
00:32:38,599 --> 00:32:39,279
Yes!

618
00:32:39,599 --> 00:32:40,759
Thank you for sparing me, Baron.

619
00:32:40,759 --> 00:32:41,279
Get out!

620
00:33:27,720 --> 00:33:28,319
Baron.

621
00:33:29,119 --> 00:33:29,880
Sit.

622
00:33:36,960 --> 00:33:37,839
Your brother...

623
00:33:38,519 --> 00:33:39,200
He's fine.

624
00:33:39,200 --> 00:33:40,000
Just lost a piece of flesh.

625
00:33:40,000 --> 00:33:40,880
Didn't hit bone.

626
00:33:41,000 --> 00:33:41,759
He'll live.

627
00:33:42,359 --> 00:33:43,279
Keep a close eye on him.

628
00:33:43,519 --> 00:33:45,279
The court's bearing down on us hard now.

629
00:33:45,920 --> 00:33:47,000
He's hot-tempered.

630
00:33:47,000 --> 00:33:48,119
If he goes out again,

631
00:33:49,000 --> 00:33:50,240
he won't be so lucky.

632
00:33:50,759 --> 00:33:51,480
Don't worry, Baron.

633
00:33:51,599 --> 00:33:52,799
If he's that reckless again,

634
00:33:53,000 --> 00:33:53,799
we won't bother with the rules.

635
00:33:53,839 --> 00:33:55,279
I'll break his legs myself.

636
00:33:59,839 --> 00:34:01,079
I had Li make this for you.

637
00:34:02,519 --> 00:34:03,640
Not sure if it fits.

638
00:34:11,119 --> 00:34:12,240
Don't be so impulsive anymore.

639
00:34:25,480 --> 00:34:26,280
Ms. Meng,

640
00:34:26,440 --> 00:34:27,000
you look much better

641
00:34:27,000 --> 00:34:28,079
than a few days ago.

642
00:34:28,440 --> 00:34:29,559
But you still need more rest.

643
00:34:30,280 --> 00:34:31,480
I've rested long enough.

644
00:34:32,800 --> 00:34:33,920
I'd like to go for a walk.

645
00:34:35,039 --> 00:34:36,960
I heard the Imperial Garden is beautiful.

646
00:34:38,440 --> 00:34:40,719
Does His Majesty go there often?

647
00:34:41,519 --> 00:34:43,199
He sometimes takes a short break there

648
00:34:43,280 --> 00:34:44,800
between reviewing memorials.

649
00:34:50,239 --> 00:34:50,840
Ms. Meng,

650
00:34:50,840 --> 00:34:52,199
get some rest.

651
00:34:57,079 --> 00:34:58,599
[I'm fully recovered now.]

652
00:34:59,719 --> 00:35:00,960
[The Palace Exam is coming soon.]

653
00:35:01,880 --> 00:35:03,840
[I have to seize the opportunity.]

654
00:35:09,079 --> 00:35:10,840
This was my mother's favorite flower.

655
00:35:13,360 --> 00:35:14,239
What a shame.

656
00:35:15,559 --> 00:35:17,199
A good flower can't bloom from bad soil.

657
00:35:18,360 --> 00:35:19,079
Huang Bo,

658
00:35:20,000 --> 00:35:21,159
get another sapling.

659
00:35:21,519 --> 00:35:22,039
Yes.

660
00:35:37,400 --> 00:35:38,800
I called you here

661
00:35:39,239 --> 00:35:40,519
to discuss one something.

662
00:35:41,480 --> 00:35:42,960
I want to establish The Surveillance Bureau.

663
00:35:43,400 --> 00:35:45,079
Independent of chancellors and ministries.

664
00:35:45,079 --> 00:35:46,519
It can monitor all officials,

665
00:35:46,519 --> 00:35:47,920
and root out evil below.

666
00:35:47,920 --> 00:35:49,039
Reporting directly to me.

667
00:35:50,920 --> 00:35:51,559
Your Majesty.

668
00:35:52,719 --> 00:35:53,400
Here.

669
00:35:57,199 --> 00:35:59,199
Your Majesty, if you want new talent...

670
00:36:00,559 --> 00:36:02,599
These seedlings may have no pests,

671
00:36:02,599 --> 00:36:03,840
but their roots are shallow.

672
00:36:04,599 --> 00:36:05,760
They can't withstand storms.

673
00:36:13,000 --> 00:36:14,079
[The Surveillance Bureau?]

674
00:36:15,079 --> 00:36:15,920
Is Ms. Meng

675
00:36:16,000 --> 00:36:17,559
still resting in the palace?

676
00:36:17,960 --> 00:36:18,800
Of course.

677
00:36:18,800 --> 00:36:20,119
His Majesty is so tender and caring.

678
00:36:20,119 --> 00:36:21,719
Imperial physicians and tonics.

679
00:36:21,719 --> 00:36:23,320
Nothing but the best care.

680
00:36:29,519 --> 00:36:30,519
Chancellor Xu is

681
00:36:30,519 --> 00:36:32,079
watching the aftermath of the women's exam.

682
00:36:32,519 --> 00:36:34,360
Your Majesty, if you bring Ms. Meng back now,

683
00:36:34,360 --> 00:36:34,960
I'm afraid...

684
00:36:34,960 --> 00:36:36,599
Bringing new scholars into court

685
00:36:36,599 --> 00:36:38,519
is exactly how we counter Chancellor Xu.

686
00:36:40,360 --> 00:36:41,840
It was the Ministry of Rites' negligence

687
00:36:41,840 --> 00:36:43,719
that harmed Ms. Meng.

688
00:36:44,239 --> 00:36:45,239
The Palace Exam is approaching.

689
00:36:45,519 --> 00:36:46,760
I just want her

690
00:36:46,760 --> 00:36:47,960
to recover soon

691
00:36:47,960 --> 00:36:49,320
and prepare with peace of mind.

692
00:36:51,400 --> 00:36:52,079
Your Majesty,

693
00:36:52,599 --> 00:36:54,239
if Ms. Meng stays in the palace too long,

694
00:36:54,239 --> 00:36:55,440
people will talk.

695
00:36:56,280 --> 00:36:57,239
Chancellor Xu's faction

696
00:36:57,239 --> 00:36:58,480
is already watching closely.

697
00:36:59,440 --> 00:37:00,880
If they use this against you,

698
00:37:01,320 --> 00:37:03,039
it could damage your reputation

699
00:37:03,440 --> 00:37:05,480
and hurt Ms. Meng's future as well.

700
00:37:11,079 --> 00:37:12,519
You're absolutely right.

701
00:37:12,800 --> 00:37:13,719
Then have the imperial physician

702
00:37:13,719 --> 00:37:15,199
examine Ms. Meng again.

703
00:37:15,800 --> 00:37:16,559
If she's well,

704
00:37:16,559 --> 00:37:17,880
send her out of the palace immediately.

705
00:38:09,239 --> 00:38:10,559
The world is dark.

706
00:38:11,679 --> 00:38:12,800
The night is endless.

707
00:38:19,440 --> 00:38:20,800
Heaven is cruel.

708
00:38:22,480 --> 00:38:23,760
Tears soak my clothes!

709
00:38:24,079 --> 00:38:24,719
Your Majesty,

710
00:38:25,400 --> 00:38:26,400
should I stop her?

711
00:38:27,119 --> 00:38:28,360
Let her vent.

712
00:38:33,599 --> 00:38:35,159
Why fear

713
00:38:35,840 --> 00:38:37,320
the raging storm?

714
00:38:38,880 --> 00:38:42,559
I am the sword that slays demons!

715
00:38:45,280 --> 00:38:46,280
Ms. Meng has that wild spirit

716
00:38:46,280 --> 00:38:47,440
of Shazhou in her.

717
00:38:47,760 --> 00:38:48,880
You should have seen her.

718
00:38:49,039 --> 00:38:50,280
She's fierce when interrogating too.

719
00:38:50,880 --> 00:38:51,599
In no time,

720
00:38:51,679 --> 00:38:52,480
Jiang Mei'er confessed everything.

721
00:38:52,480 --> 00:38:53,760
She's never been ordinary.

722
00:38:54,239 --> 00:38:55,360
This setback

723
00:38:55,880 --> 00:38:58,000
will only make her more determined.

724
00:39:00,159 --> 00:39:01,039
Her next move

725
00:39:02,800 --> 00:39:03,880
will be to find herself

726
00:39:03,880 --> 00:39:05,800
a powerful backer.

727
00:39:06,440 --> 00:39:07,199
Your Majesty,

728
00:39:07,960 --> 00:39:09,320
Ms. Meng just recovered.

729
00:39:09,519 --> 00:39:11,079
If she's out in the rain, she'll get sick

730
00:39:11,159 --> 00:39:12,400
and miss the Palace Exam.

731
00:39:12,880 --> 00:39:13,559
Maybe

732
00:39:14,000 --> 00:39:15,400
I should take her back now.

733
00:39:30,320 --> 00:39:32,159
Why are you torturing yourself?

734
00:39:37,000 --> 00:39:38,400
Hal.

735
00:39:46,480 --> 00:39:47,519
Don't worry, Your Majesty.

736
00:39:48,199 --> 00:39:50,079
Ms. Meng just caught a chill.

737
00:39:50,079 --> 00:39:51,079
Nothing serious.

738
00:39:51,639 --> 00:39:52,679
Once she sobers up,

739
00:39:52,800 --> 00:39:54,039
one dose of cold remedy

740
00:39:54,039 --> 00:39:55,079
and she'll be fine.

741
00:39:55,079 --> 00:39:56,159
You may leave.

742
00:39:56,519 --> 00:39:57,079
Yes.

743
00:40:03,719 --> 00:40:04,519
Your Majesty,

744
00:40:04,800 --> 00:40:05,840
she's fine.

745
00:40:05,840 --> 00:40:06,719
It's getting late.

746
00:40:06,719 --> 00:40:08,280
We should head back.

747
00:40:14,360 --> 00:40:15,119
Hal.

748
00:40:32,920 --> 00:40:34,000
No need for formalities.

749
00:40:35,880 --> 00:40:36,519
No.

750
00:40:37,239 --> 00:40:38,360
You're the Emperor.

751
00:40:39,440 --> 00:40:40,719
I have to.

752
00:40:43,280 --> 00:40:45,800
Greetings, Your Majesty.

753
00:40:51,760 --> 00:40:52,760
You may leave.

754
00:40:53,159 --> 00:40:53,920
Your Majesty...

755
00:40:53,920 --> 00:40:55,039
I know what I'm doing.

756
00:41:13,639 --> 00:41:15,920
I never expected that Hal, who went through

757
00:41:15,920 --> 00:41:18,199
life and death with me in Shazhou,

758
00:41:20,039 --> 00:41:21,639
would be the Emperor.

759
00:41:22,960 --> 00:41:24,599
If you hadn't shown up

760
00:41:24,599 --> 00:41:26,400
that day at the capital prefecture,

761
00:41:27,039 --> 00:41:28,119
I would have been

762
00:41:29,440 --> 00:41:31,360
dead and in pieces.

763
00:41:43,840 --> 00:41:45,679
Thank you for saving me, Your Majesty.

764
00:41:46,159 --> 00:41:47,039
I

765
00:41:47,880 --> 00:41:49,559
don't know how to repay you.

766
00:42:00,519 --> 00:42:01,599
The exam fraud

767
00:42:02,000 --> 00:42:03,119
and the Ministry of Rites' negligence

768
00:42:03,360 --> 00:42:04,400
were my failure.

769
00:42:04,960 --> 00:42:06,039
You suffered because of it.

770
00:42:06,639 --> 00:42:08,000
If you truly want to repay me,

771
00:42:08,679 --> 00:42:10,760
stop destroying your own health.

772
00:42:11,360 --> 00:42:12,719
Focus on preparing for the exam.

773
00:42:12,760 --> 00:42:14,440
Back in Shazhou,

774
00:42:15,599 --> 00:42:17,400
you gave me a chance,

775
00:42:17,800 --> 00:42:18,639
and I turned down

776
00:42:18,639 --> 00:42:20,360
your kind offer.

777
00:42:21,559 --> 00:42:22,800
Now I understand.

778
00:42:23,079 --> 00:42:24,760
In this devouring world,

779
00:42:24,840 --> 00:42:27,880
being too proud will get you killed.

780
00:42:28,679 --> 00:42:29,760
I'm so scared.

781
00:42:30,159 --> 00:42:31,400
Scared that one day

782
00:42:32,599 --> 00:42:34,519
even you won't be able to protect me.
